        "docs/diacritic-normalization-map.md — Tier 2 (Czech/Lithuanian class), survey 2026-06-11",
        "Wikipedia: Jiří Pelikán"
      ],
      "fields": {
        "historical_notes": "Anatoly Vaisser (b. 1949 Novosibirsk, later France) is the player most associated with promoting 10...Bg7. The corpus does not support the claim that he played it FIRST — the earliest game in the Gigabase is Fraile–Pelikán 1972 — but Vaisser is the GM who turned it into a recognised treatment from the mid-1980s on. The variant inherits its name from his hometown."
      }
    },
